        <mxCell id="dc-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Pipeline variants&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;mvp&lt;/b&gt; — all five tag orders kept.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;mvp_aos&lt;/b&gt; — same, then filtered down to &lt;i&gt;order == 'AOS'&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;gas / gas_bar&lt;/b&gt; — no A/O/S modes; steps 2 and 3 are skipped and the whole triplet string is the label.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;--filter_data&lt;/b&gt; — when omitted, every row is marked &lt;i&gt;is_match = True&lt;/i&gt; and the generation-based filter is skipped." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b0b0b0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;size=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
