        <mxCell id="ev-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Per-order scoring.&lt;/b&gt; Test items carry an &lt;i&gt;element_order&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;i&gt;aos&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;aso&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;sao&lt;/i&gt;, &amp;#8230;). Predictions are bucketed by that key and &lt;i&gt;calculate_metrics&lt;/i&gt; runs once per bucket, so the result file holds &lt;i&gt;precision_&amp;lt;order&amp;gt;&lt;/i&gt; / &lt;i&gt;recall_&amp;lt;order&amp;gt;&lt;/i&gt; / &lt;i&gt;f1_&amp;lt;order&amp;gt;&lt;/i&gt; triples, scaled by 100." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b0b0b0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;size=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
